# Colang definitions for topical and safety guardrails

define user ask off topic
  "What is the weather in Paris?"
  "Tell me a joke"
  "Who won the soccer match?"
  "How do I cook pasta?"

define flow check off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot refuse off topic

define bot refuse off topic
  "I am OmniBrain, an agentic multi-modal research assistant specialized in document and financial analysis. I can only assist with questions related to your uploaded documents and structured financial data."
